{"id":"c5ed5575b30a3867","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-sw-complexity.md","title":"sw归约控制两种初段复杂度","display":"thm-sw-complexity — sw归约控制两种初段复杂度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-sw-complexity","aliases":["43-thm-sw-complexity"],"display":"thm-sw-complexity — sw归约控制两种初段复杂度","depends_on":["[[43-df-sw-red]]","[[43-df-complexity-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"§13.5, consequence of Definition 13.5.2 and Lemma 13.2.4","source_printed_pages":"352","source_pdf_pages":"372","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-sw-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-sw-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sw-complexity — sw归约控制两种初段复杂度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cae575293a2fb87\" href=\"?note=8cae575293a2fb87\" title=\"43-df-sw-red\">43-df-sw-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13.5, consequence of Definition 13.5.2 and Lemma 13.2.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"352"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"372"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\rm sw}\">\\(\\le_{\\rm sw}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_C\">\\(\\le_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_K\">\\(\\le_K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8cae575293a2fb87\" href=\"?note=8cae575293a2fb87\" title=\"43-df-sw-red\">43-df-sw-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\Rightarrow X\\le_CY\\land X\\le_KY.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\Rightarrow X\\le_CY\\land X\\le_KY.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>计算X的长度n初段最多需要Y的n+c位。描述Y的n位并硬编码至多c个余位，固定编译器可恢复X的n位；有限余位与程序开销均吸收到一个常数。书中明确不要求X、Y左c.e.。本地短论证已核对；未重验Lemma13.2.4的一般形式。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，§13.5, consequence of Definition 13.5.2 and Lemma 13.2.4；印刷页352，PDF页372。核对了本条所述短证明组合；底层定理证明并非全部重验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sw-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\rm sw}$、$\\le_C$、$\\le_K$ 见 [[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\rm sw}$、$\\le_C$、$\\le_K$ 见 [[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\rm sw}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_K","display":false},{"tex":"X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\Rightarrow X\\le_CY\\land X\\le_KY.","display":true}],"bytes":1474,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-333","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-sw-complexity]] — sw归约控制两种初段复杂度"}],"outgoing":["8cae575293a2fb87","9d68ed64bfec741d"]}